# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"PDF Arranger merges, splits, rearranges, rotates and crops PDF documents. "
"Everything happens in memory against the pages you can see; nothing is "
"written until you save."
msgstr ""
"PDF Arranger fusiona, devesís, reorganiza, vira e retalha de documents PDF. "
"Tot se passa en memòria sus las paginas que vesètz ; res es pas escrich fins"
" que enregistretz."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"It is a front end for pikepdf. Page content is never rewritten — only page "
"order, geometry and composition."
msgstr ""
"Es una interfàcia per pikepdf. Lo contengut de las paginas es pas jamai "
"reescrich — solament l'òrdre de las paginas, la geometria e la composicion."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Linha de comanda"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Files given on the command line are opened as one document. "
"<code>--version</code> prints the version and exits."
msgstr ""
"Los fichièrs balhats sus la linha de comanda son dobèrts coma un sol "
"document. <code>--version</code> aficha la version e quita."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/mainwindow.py
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Lectura"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The application opens in <b>read mode</b>: a continuous page view for "
"reading the document rather than rearranging it. <b>View ▸ Arrange Mode</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) swaps to the thumbnail grid and back."
msgstr ""
"L'aplicacion se dobrís en <b>mòde lectura</b> : un afichatge contunh de las "
"paginas per legir lo document puslèu que per lo reorganizar. <b>Afichatge ▸ "
"Mòde d'ordenament</b> (Ctrl+E) bascula cap a la grasilha de miniaturas e "
"tòrna."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Reading shows the document <i>as edited</i>: rotations, crops, deletions and"
" reordering are all applied, so what you read is what you would get if you "
"saved. Page-editing commands are disabled while reading — bookmarks are the "
"exception, and are edited here and nowhere else."
msgstr ""
"La lectura mòstra lo document <i>tal coma es estat modificat</i> : "
"rotacions, retalhs, supressions e reorganizacions son totes aplicats, doncas"
" çò que legissètz es çò qu'auriatz s'enregistravatz. Las comandas de "
"modificacion de las paginas son desactivadas pendent la lectura — los "
"marcapaginas son l'excepcion, e se modifican aicí e enluòc mai."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The page you are on follows you between the two modes. Switching to read "
"mode opens at the page selected in the grid, the first of them if several "
"are selected; switching back scrolls the grid to the page you were reading, "
"without disturbing what you had selected. With nothing selected, reading "
"resumes where you left off — your place in each document is remembered "
"between visits."
msgstr ""
"La pagina ont sètz vos seguís entre los dos mòdes. Bascular en mòde lectura "
"dobrís a la pagina seleccionada dins la grasilha, la primièra se n'i a "
"mantunas ; tornar bascular fa desfilar la grasilha fins a la pagina que "
"legissiatz, sens tocar çò qu'aviatz seleccionat. Sens seleccion, la lectura "
"reprend ont l'aviatz daissada — vòstre endrech dins cada document es "
"memorizat entre las visitas."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The toolbar shows which page you are on and how many there are; type a "
"number into it to jump there, or use <b>Ctrl+G</b>."
msgstr ""
"La barra d'aisinas mòstra sus quina pagina sètz e quantas n'i a ; picatz-i "
"un numèro per i sautar, o utilizatz <b>Ctrl+G</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>View ▸ Continuous Scroll</b> is on by default; turning it off shows one "
"page at a time. <b>View ▸ Facing Pages</b> puts two pages side by side, the "
"way a book falls open. Both settings are remembered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Afichatge ▸ Desfilament contunh</b> es activat per defaut ; lo desactivar"
" aficha una pagina a l'encòp. <b>Afichatge ▸ Paginas en fàcia</b> met doas "
"paginas costat a costat, coma un libre que se dobrís. Los dos reglatges son "
"memorizats."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around a document"
msgstr "Se desplaçar dins un document"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"One rule for the arrow keys: <b>the modifier decides what moves</b>. Nothing"
" scrolls the view, Option (Alt) moves the text cursor, Shift extends the "
"selection, Command (Ctrl) jumps to an edge, and Fn — Page Up, Page Down, "
"Home and End — jumps further. None of it changes according to whether a text"
" cursor happens to be on the page."
msgstr ""
"Una sola règla per las tòcas de direccion : <b>lo modificador decidís çò que"
" se bolega</b>. Cap fa desfilar l'afichatge, Option (Alt) desplaça lo cursor"
" de tèxte, Maj espandís la seleccion, Command (Ctrl) sauta a un bòrd, e Fn —"
" Pag prec., Pag seg., Origina e Fin — sauta mai luènh. Res d'aquò càmbia pas"
" segon qu'i aja o non un cursor de tèxte sus la pagina."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Tòcas"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Continuous"
msgstr "Contunh"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/viewer.py
msgid "One page at a time"
msgstr "Una pagina a l'encòp"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one line"
msgstr "far desfilar d'una linha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "top of the previous / next page"
msgstr "naut de la pagina precedenta / seguenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "previous / next page"
msgstr "pagina precedenta / seguenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one screen"
msgstr "far desfilar d'un ecran"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "start / end of the document"
msgstr "començament / fin del document"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor, by character or line"
msgstr "desplaçar lo cursor de tèxte, per caractèr o per linha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection, by character or line"
msgstr "espandir la seleccion, per caractèr o per linha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor one word"
msgstr "desplaçar lo cursor de tèxte d'un mot"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection one word"
msgstr "espandir la seleccion d'un mot"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the line"
msgstr "cursor al començament / a la fin de la linha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the document"
msgstr "cursor al començament / a la fin del document"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Add Shift to a Command or Option combination to extend the selection instead"
" of moving — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> selects to the end of the line. Adding "
"Option works by the word rather than the character. On Windows and Linux, "
"read Command as Ctrl and Option as Alt; the table is the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Apondètz Maj a una combinason amb Command o Option per espandir la seleccion"
" puslèu que de vos desplaçar — <b>Maj+Command+→</b> selecciona fins a la fin"
" de la linha. Apondre Option fa trabalhar per mots puslèu que per caractèrs."
" Sus Windows e Linux, legissètz Command coma Ctrl e Option coma Alt ; la "
"taula es la meteissa pertot."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Selecting and copying text"
msgstr "Seleccionar e copiar de tèxte"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag across the page to select text, across page boundaries if you keep "
"going. <b>Double-click</b> selects a word. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> copies, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selects the text of the page you are on, and <b>Esc</b> "
"clears the selection. The same commands are on the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Lisatz sus la pagina per seleccionar de tèxte, e a travèrs las bòrnas de las"
" paginas se contunhatz. Lo <b>doble clic</b> selecciona un mot. "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> còpia, <b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selecciona lo tèxte de la pagina "
"ont sètz, e <b>Escap</b> escafa la seleccion. Las meteissas comandas son "
"dins lo menú del clic drech."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Shift+click</b> extends an existing selection to where you clicked. The "
"end you are moving grows out to a whole word, because a single click is an "
"imprecise way to point at one character; the end you started from stays "
"exactly where you put it. Dragging selects by character throughout, since "
"you can watch it and stop where you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>Maj+clic</b> espandís una seleccion existenta fins a ont avètz clicat. Lo"
" cap que desplaçatz crèis fins a un mot entièr, perque un sol clic es un "
"biais imprecís de puntar un caractèr ; lo cap d'ont sètz partit demòra "
"exactament ont l'avètz pausat. Lisar selecciona per caractèrs tot del long, "
"perque lo podètz seguir e vos arrestar ont volètz."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Clicking on text leaves a blinking <b>text cursor</b>. That is what "
"Shift+arrow extends from, and what the Option and Command combinations above"
" move. It stays where you put it — scrolling, paging and clicking off the "
"page all leave it alone — until you press Esc or open another document."
msgstr ""
"Clicar sul tèxte daissa un <b>cursor de tèxte</b> que clineja. Es d'aquí que"
" Maj+sageta espandís, e es el que las combinasons Option e Command çai-sus "
"desplaçan. Demòra ont l'avètz pausat — lo desfilament, lo cambiament de "
"pagina e un clic fòra de la pagina lo tòcan pas — fins que quichetz Escap o "
"dobriscatz un autre document."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Following links"
msgstr "Seguir los ligams"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Click a link to follow it. Links to a page in the same document jump there; "
"links to the web open in your browser. Hovering over one shows where it "
"goes, which is worth reading before you click: many links in a PDF are not "
"written by its author at all but inferred from the text, so what a link "
"points at is not always what the words appear to say."
msgstr ""
"Clicatz un ligam per lo seguir. Los ligams cap a una pagina del meteis "
"document i sautan ; los ligams cap al web se dobrisson dins vòstre "
"navegador. Passar dessús mòstra ont mena, e aquò val la pena d'èsser legit "
"abans de clicar : fòrça ligams dins un PDF son pas escriches per l'autor mas"
" deduches del tèxte, doncas çò que punta un ligam es pas totjorn çò que los "
"mots semblan dire."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Only ordinary web and mail links are handed to the system — http, https, "
"mailto and ftp. A document is a file that arrived from somewhere, and "
"anything else it asks to open is refused and reported rather than acted on."
msgstr ""
"Sols los ligams web e de corrièl abituals son transmeses al sistèma — http, "
"https, mailto e ftp. Un document es un fichièr vengut de qualque part, e tot"
" çò mai que demanda de dobrir es refusat e senhalat puslèu que d'èsser "
"executat."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Right-clicking a link offers <b>Open Link</b> and <b>Copy Link Address</b>."
msgstr ""
"Un clic drech sus un ligam prepausa <b>Dobrir lo ligam</b> e <b>Copiar "
"l'adreça del ligam</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Marcapaginas"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The sidebar shows the document's bookmarks. Click one to jump to it. "
"Everything below is on the sidebar's right-click menu, and every command can"
" be undone."
msgstr ""
"Lo panèl lateral mòstra los marcapaginas del document. Clicatz-ne un per i "
"sautar. Tot çò que seguís es dins lo menú del clic drech del panèl lateral, "
"e cada comanda se pòt anullar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Add Bookmark Here</b> makes one pointing at the page you are reading, "
"named after whatever text you have selected — so select a heading, then add."
" With nothing selected it is named after the page. <b>Add Child Bookmark "
"Here</b> does the same, nested under the entry you clicked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Apondre un marcapaginas aicí</b> ne crèa un que punta sus la pagina que "
"legissètz, nomenat segon lo tèxte qu'avètz seleccionat — seleccionatz doncas"
" un títol, puèi apondètz. Sens seleccion es nomenat segon la pagina. "
"<b>Apondre un marcapaginas filh aicí</b> fa parièr, imbricat jos l'entrada "
"qu'avètz clicada."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Rename</b> edits the title in place. <b>Re-home to This Page</b> points "
"an existing bookmark at the page you are on, keeping its title. "
"<b>Delete</b> removes an entry and <i>promotes</i> its children into its "
"place; <b>Delete with Children</b> removes the whole branch."
msgstr ""
"<b>Renomenar</b> modifica lo títol sul pic. <b>Tornar puntar sus aquesta "
"pagina</b> fa puntar un marcapaginas existent sus la pagina ont sètz, en "
"gardant son títol. <b>Suprimir</b> lèva una entrada e <i>promòu</i> sos "
"filhs a sa plaça ; <b>Suprimir amb los filhs</b> lèva tota la branca."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag entries within the sidebar to re-nest or reorder them. <b>Expand All "
"Children</b> and <b>Collapse All Children</b> open or shut a whole branch at"
" once."
msgstr ""
"Lisatz d'entradas dins lo panèl lateral per las tornar imbricar o reordenar."
" <b>Desplegar totes los filhs</b> e <b>Plegar totes los filhs</b> dobrisson "
"o barran tota una branca d'un còp."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Style</b> sets a bookmark bold or italic, or gives it a colour, as the "
"tree shows."
msgstr ""
"<b>Estil</b> met un marcapaginas en gras o en italic, o li balha una color, "
"coma l'arbre o mòstra."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"A bookmark whose page has been deleted is <b>greyed out</b> rather than "
"removed: its title may still be worth keeping, and you can point it "
"somewhere else with Re-home. Undoing the deletion reconnects it. <b>Delete "
"Dangling Bookmarks</b> clears them all out; it leaves alone any entry that "
"points nowhere on purpose, which is a legitimate way to write a heading."
msgstr ""
"Un marcapaginas que sa pagina es estada suprimida es <b>grisat</b> puslèu "
"que levat : son títol pòt encara valer la pena, e lo podètz tornar puntar "
"endacòm mai. Anullar la supression lo torna connectar. <b>Suprimir los "
"marcapaginas penjolats</b> los netèja totes ; daissa tranquilla tota entrada"
" que punta enluòc a prepaus, çò qu'es un biais legitim d'escriure un títol."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Bookmark edits are part of the document and are written when you save, along"
" with each entry's colour and style and which branches are left open. The "
"one thing that cannot be saved is a bookmark with no page: there is no way "
"to record “points at a page that is gone”, so it comes back as a heading "
"with its title intact."
msgstr ""
"Las modificacions dels marcapaginas fan part del document e son escrichas "
"quand enregistratz, amb la color e l'estil de cada entrada e quinas brancas "
"demòran dobèrtas. La sola causa que se pòt pas enregistrar es un "
"marcapaginas sens pagina : i a pas cap de biais de notar « punta sus una "
"pagina qu'es pas mai aquí », doncas torna coma un títol amb son nom intacte."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Arranging pages"
msgstr "Ordenar las paginas"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages to reorder them. Hold <b>Ctrl</b> while dropping to copy instead "
"of move."
msgstr ""
"Lisatz las paginas per las reordenar. Manténer <b>Ctrl</b> en las daissant "
"anar còpia puslèu que de desplaçar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages onto another window of the application to copy them there, or use"
" ordinary copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"Lisatz de paginas sus una autra fenèstra de l'aplicacion per las i copiar, o"
" utilizatz lo copiar-pegar abitual."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Paste As Odd/Even Pages</b> interleaves the clipboard with the document —"
" this is how two single-sided scans of a double-sided original are "
"recombined. If the second scan came off a duplex feeder it will be in "
"reverse order; use <b>Arrange ▸ Reverse Order</b> on it first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pegar coma paginas imparas/parras</b> entrelaça lo quichapapièrs amb lo "
"document — atal se tornan amassar dos numerizacions d'un sol costat d'un "
"original recto-verso. Se la segonda numerizacion es sortida d'un alimentador"
" recto-verso serà en òrdre invèrs ; utilizatz-i d'en primièr <b>Ordenar ▸ "
"Inversar l'òrdre</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"To move pages a long way, use <b>Move to Start</b>, <b>Move to End</b> or "
"<b>Move to Page…</b> rather than dragging — in a long document the far end "
"is a great deal of scrolling away. They are on the Edit menu and on the "
"right-click menu, and <b>Move to Page…</b> asks for the number the page "
"should <i>become</i>."
msgstr ""
"Per desplaçar de paginas luènh, utilizatz <b>Desplaçar al començament</b>, "
"<b>Desplaçar a la fin</b> o <b>Desplaçar a la pagina…</b> puslèu que de "
"lisar — dins un document long l'autre cap es a fòrça desfilament. Son dins "
"lo menú Edicion e dins lo menú del clic drech, e <b>Desplaçar a la "
"pagina…</b> demanda lo numèro que la pagina deu <i>venir</i>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Prefer these to cut and paste for moving. A pasted page is a <i>new</i> page"
" as far as the document is concerned, so any bookmarks pointing at the "
"original are left behind with nowhere to go. Moving keeps the page itself, "
"and its bookmarks come with it."
msgstr ""
"Per desplaçar, preferissètz-los al talhar-pegar. Una pagina pegada es una "
"pagina <i>novèla</i> pel document, doncas los marcapaginas que puntavan sus "
"l'originala demòran enrè sens destinacion. Desplaçar garda la pagina "
"meteissa, e sos marcapaginas venon amb ela."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Stamping and tiling"
msgstr "Estampar e assemblar"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Page ▸ Add Page Numbers…</b> and <b>Page ▸ Add Watermark…</b> draw text "
"onto the selected pages. Both add a <i>layer</i> rather than rewriting the "
"page, so both can be undone and neither touches the file you opened."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pagina ▸ Apondre de numèros de pagina…</b> e <b>Pagina ▸ Apondre una "
"filigrana…</b> dessenhan de tèxte sus las paginas seleccionadas. Los dos "
"apondon una <i>jaça</i> puslèu que de reescriure la pagina, doncas los dos "
"se pòdon anullar e cap tòca pas lo fichièr qu'avètz dobèrt."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Page numbers follow the arrangement, not the source document: they are "
"numbered in the order the pages are in now. <code>{n}</code> in the format "
"is the page number and <code>{total}</code> the number of pages, so "
"<code>Page {n} of {total}</code> does what it looks like."
msgstr ""
"Los numèros de pagina seguisson l'ordenament, pas lo document d'origina : "
"son numerotats dins l'òrdre ont las paginas son ara. <code>{n}</code> dins "
"lo format es lo numèro de pagina e <code>{total}</code> lo nombre de "
"paginas, doncas <code>Pagina {n} sus {total}</code> fa çò que sembla."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrange ▸ Pages per Sheet…</b> tiles several pages onto one, in reading "
"order — the printer's <i>N-up</i>. The sheet turns sideways when that lets "
"the pages come out larger, which is why two-up gives a landscape sheet and "
"four-up does not."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ordenar ▸ Paginas per fuèlh…</b> dispausa mantunas paginas sus una sola, "
"dins l'òrdre de lectura — lo <i>N-up</i> de l'estampaire. Lo fuèlh vira de "
"costat quand aquò fa sortir las paginas mai grandas, e es per aquò que doas "
"per fuèlh donan un fuèlh orizontal e quatre per fuèlh non."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Saving a document"
msgstr "Enregistrar un document"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Optimize for the web</b> in Preferences lays the saved file out so a "
"browser can show the first page before the rest has arrived. <b>Compress</b>"
" repacks its streams and objects; how much that saves depends entirely on "
"the file, and one full of photographs will barely move."
msgstr ""
"<b>Optimizar pel web</b> dins las Preferéncias dispausa lo fichièr "
"enregistrat per qu'un navegador pòsca mostrar la primièra pagina abans que "
"la rèsta siá arribada. <b>Compressar</b> torna empaquetar sos fluxes e "
"objèctes ; çò qu'aquò estalvia depend entièrament del fichièr, e un fichièr "
"plen de fotografias se bolega gaireben pas."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Remove All Metadata</b> is a switch, like Password: turn it on and"
" the next save writes a document with no title, no author and no record of "
"what produced it. Edit Properties greys out while it is on, because there "
"would be nothing to edit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fichièr ▸ Suprimir totas las metadonadas</b> es un interruptor, coma lo "
"Senhal : activatz-lo e l'enregistrament seguent escriurà un document sens "
"títol, sens autor e sens cap de traça de çò que l'a produch. Modificar las "
"proprietats es grisat tant qu'es activat, perque i auriá res a modificar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Viewer Preferences…</b> is how the saved document asks a reader to"
" open it — with the bookmarks showing, two pages at a time, and so on. "
"Readers are free to ignore all of it. The settings are read from the file "
"you opened, so a document that already had them keeps them."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fichièr ▸ Preferéncias del visualizador…</b> es lo biais que lo document "
"enregistrat demanda a un lector de lo dobrir — amb los marcapaginas "
"visibles, doas paginas a l'encòp, e atal. Los lectors an lo drech d'ignorar "
"tot aquò. Los reglatges son legits del fichièr qu'avètz dobèrt, doncas un "
"document que ne dispausava ja los garda."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Repair Document…</b> rebuilds a damaged PDF. It works on a file "
"you pick rather than the one on screen, because the file worth repairing is "
"usually one this application cannot open properly either. It reports what it"
" found before writing anything."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fichièr ▸ Reparar lo document…</b> reconstruís un PDF degalhat. Trabalha "
"sus un fichièr que causissètz e pas sus aquel de l'ecran, perque lo fichièr "
"que val la pena d'èsser reparat es sovent un qu'aquesta aplicacion pòt pas "
"dobrir corrèctament tanpauc. Senhala çò qu'a trobat abans d'escriure quicòm "
"mai."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Mirga"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Ctrl + scroll</b> — zoom"
msgstr "<b>Ctrl + desfilament</b> — zoom"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Shift + scroll</b> — scroll sideways"
msgstr "<b>Maj + desfilament</b> — desfilament lateral"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Alt + scroll</b> — scroll exactly one row"
msgstr "<b>Alt + desfilament</b> — desfilar exactament una linha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Double-click</b> — fit the page to the window, and back"
msgstr "<b>Doble clic</b> — ajustar la pagina a la fenèstra, e tornar"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Click and drag</b> on empty space — rubber-band select; keep scrolling to"
" extend it"
msgstr ""
"<b>Clicar e lisar</b> sus un espaci void — seleccion per encastre ; "
"contunhatz de far desfilar per l'espandir"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around the grid"
msgstr "Se desplaçar dins la grasilha"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrow keys</b> move between pages, <b>Page Up</b> and <b>Page Down</b> "
"move a screenful at a time, and <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> jump to the first"
" and last page. Hold <b>Shift</b> with any of them to extend the selection."
msgstr ""
"<b>Las tòcas de direccion</b> se desplaçan entre las paginas, <b>Pag "
"prec.</b> e <b>Pag seg.</b> se desplaçan d'un ecran a l'encòp, e "
"<b>Origina</b> e <b>Fin</b> sautan a la primièra e a la darrièra pagina. "
"Manténer <b>Maj</b> amb una d'elas espandís la seleccion."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Fit One Page</b> (F) scales so a whole page fits in the window and shows "
"one page per row — use it to work on a single page at a time. <b>Fit "
"Multiple Pages</b> (Shift+M) uses the same scale but lets as many pages sit "
"side by side as the window takes. <b>Fit Width</b> (Shift+F) fills the "
"window across instead, which shows the page wider but taller than the "
"window. Double-clicking the grid toggles Fit One Page on and off."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ajustar una pagina</b> (F) met a l'escala per qu'una pagina entièra "
"dintre dins la fenèstra e aficha una pagina per linha — utilizatz-o per "
"trabalhar sus una pagina a l'encòp. <b>Ajustar mantunas paginas</b> (Maj+M) "
"utiliza la meteissa escala mas daissa tantas paginas costat a costat que la "
"fenèstra ne pòt tenir. <b>Ajustar a la largor</b> (Maj+F) emplena puslèu la "
"fenèstra en largor, çò que mòstra la pagina mai larga mas mai nauta que la "
"fenèstra. Un doble clic sus la grasilha activa e desactiva Ajustar una "
"pagina."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"With pages selected, all three fit the selection rather than the whole "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Amb de paginas seleccionadas, totas tres ajustan la seleccion puslèu que tot"
" lo document."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Finding text"
msgstr "Recercar de tèxte"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Find</b> selects the pages that contain the phrase and boxes each hit on "
"the thumbnail, so you can see where on the page it is. The boxes clear as "
"soon as you change the document, since the pages they were drawn for may "
"have moved."
msgstr ""
"<b>Recercar</b> selecciona las paginas que contenon l'expression e encastra "
"cada resultat sus la miniatura, per que vejatz ont es sus la pagina. Los "
"encastres despareisson tre que modificatz lo document, que las paginas per "
"las qualas son estats dessenhats pòdon aver bolegat."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Every shortcut can be changed in <b>Edit ▸ Preferences ▸ Keyboard "
"shortcuts</b>, where they are listed under the menu each one belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Cada acorchi se pòt cambiar dins <b>Edicion ▸ Preferéncias ▸ Acorchis de "
"clavièr</b>, ont son listats jos lo menú al qual cadun aparten."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Passwords"
msgstr "Senhals"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Opening an encrypted document asks for its password, which is remembered "
"until the document is closed."
msgstr ""
"Dobrir un document chifrat demanda son senhal, qu'es memorizat fins que lo "
"document siá barrat."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Password</b> encrypts the document when it is next saved. It is a "
"switch: turn it on and you are asked for a password, turn it off and the "
"next save is unencrypted. The password is never written to your settings, so"
" it applies to this session only — and if you forget it, the file cannot be "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fichièr ▸ Senhal</b> chifra lo document al còp d'enregistrament seguent. "
"Es un interruptor : activatz-lo e vos serà demandat un senhal, desactivatz-"
"lo e l'enregistrament seguent serà pas chifrat. Lo senhal es pas jamai "
"escrich dins vòstres reglatges, doncas s'aplica sonque a aquesta session — e"
" se l'oblidatz, lo fichièr se pòt pas recuperar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Unlock</b> goes the other way: open the document with its "
"password, choose Unlock, and the next save writes it without one. It is only"
" available when there is encryption to remove."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fichièr ▸ Desverrolhar</b> fa lo contrari : dobrissètz lo document amb "
"son senhal, causissètz Desverrolhar, e l'enregistrament seguent l'escriu "
"sens. Disponible sonque quand i a de chiframent de levar."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Fichièrs"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Settings are stored by Qt in the per-user location for this platform; on "
"Windows that is the registry under "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. There is no "
"configuration file to edit by hand."
msgstr ""
"Los reglatges son enregistrats per Qt a l'emplaçament per utilizaire "
"d'aquesta plataforma ; sus Windows es lo registre jos "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. I a pas cap de "
"fichièr de configuracion de modificar a la man."

